---
/**
 * RunDrawer — the /benchmarks run detail drawer (Task 6 of the
 * benchmarks/profiles plan). 580px, right-anchored, scrim behind, per
 * docs/design/2026-08-09-platform-handoff/README.md §Screens 2.7 and
 * "02 Benchmarks.html"'s `RunDrawer` component.
 *
 * This file is the STATIC SHELL ONLY: it ships hidden (both the scrim and
 * the drawer carry the `hidden` attribute) with the dialog semantics
 * (`role="dialog"`, `aria-modal="true"`, `aria-labelledby`) wired up, plus
 * the head chrome (eyebrow, title slot, close button) that never changes
 * per row. The body (#run-drawer-body) starts empty — bench-island.ts owns
 * populating it from `drawerModel(row)` (src/lib/bench-view.mjs) on row
 * click or on `?run=<id>` deep-link load, and clearing it on close. See
 * src/styles/site-data.css's "run drawer" section for why the section
 * classes (`.dr-metrics`, `.kv`, `.well.argv`, `.banner.warn`, `.histbox`,
 * `.dr-actions`, …) live in the shared global sheet rather than a scoped
 * <style> block here: Astro's scoped-style compiler only matches elements
 * it rendered at build time, and every drawer section is injected by
 * client JS via innerHTML, so a scoped style here would silently never
 * match.
 *
 * Snapshot rows (no run identity) get the reduced view — headline metrics
 * + identity + a note that full detail needs the live API. API rows (real
 * runId) get the full set: metrics, identity, a resolved+copyable flag
 * string, a throttle banner when `flagged`, a history sparkline section
 * (only when real history data exists — never synthesized), and
 * provenance actions linking api.hal0.dev/v1/....
 */
---

<div class="scrim" id="run-drawer-scrim" hidden></div>
<aside
  class="drawer-run"
  id="run-drawer"
  role="dialog"
  aria-modal="true"
  aria-labelledby="run-drawer-title"
  tabindex="-1"
  hidden
>
  <div class="dr-head">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">run detail</span>
      <div class="mono dr-title" id="run-drawer-title"></div>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="iconbtn" id="run-drawer-close" aria-label="Close">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M3 3l10 10M13 3L3 13" />
      </svg>
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="dr-body" id="run-drawer-body"></div>
</aside>
